# Expanded reference validation plan

Status: implemented_pending_expanded_reference. No new quantum-chemical reference calculation was performed during package development.

## Inspected primary evidence

- paper_main, PDF pages [4, 5, 6, 7, 8]: Pair definitions, Scheme4, NMR/IR diagnostic ranges and Table2 numerical absorption data inspected.
- paper_si, PDF pages [70, 71, 72, 73, 74, 82, 83, 84, 85, 86, 87, 88, 154, 155, 156, 157]: TD tables/tautomer plots and side-by-side gas/CHCl3 coordinate blocks inspected; source terminal geometries are private. Correct compound7a spectra are on154–157, not113–116; p155 NH14.07ppm/CDCl3 inspected visually.

## Reusable legacy evidence

Old6a q/M and DFT route are method context only; 6a is not substituted for the new N–Ph comparison objects. The private legacy_final_snapshot is a byte-for-byte provenance archive, not new completion evidence.

## New reference gaps

All correct matched-series references inDMF, alternative7a spectral/thermochemical panels and media-specific shielding calibration remain uncalculated.

## Minimum pilot

Confirm 5g N–Ph and all7a tautomer formulas/maps; calculate7a/8a one-solvent TD and one alternate species diagnostic before complete series.

## Full expanded validation

Execute the complete public matrix, inspect identities and raw outputs, reproduce all new differences and sensitivity analyses, and independently review the claimed discrimination. Calibrate property-specific method/sampling errors before any numerical acceptance bands. Do not reuse narrow legacy tolerances. Document failed, collapsed and unresolved candidates rather than inventing minima.

## Available route and resource boundary

ORCA/Gaussian DFT/TDDFT, GIAO shielding and harmonic frequency analysis; conformer sampling and consistent solution thermochemistry. Consult chemistry_toolbox/README.md, config/native_software_manual_profiles.yaml, native_software_docs/gaussian/QUICKSTART.md, orca/EXCITED_STATES.md, crest/CONFORMER_SEARCH.md and goodvibes/QUICKSTART.md as applicable. Listed capabilities are not proof that this expanded system has run. Use inspect_software and validate_native_job before submission. This authoring run did not submit long jobs, HPC work or paid services.
